known_secrets_laravel.bin

This file holds no key. It is a sorted sequence of 6-byte records: the first
6 bytes of the SHA-256 of one entry of a public list of known Laravel
application keys. It is produced by build/known-secrets.php from the lists
below, which are not copied into this repository.

  Derived from: laravel-crypto-killer, the files under wordlists/
    (all_github_keys.txt, crater.txt, divers.txt, dork.txt,
    invoiceninja_default.txt, keys_from_blogposts.txt,
    keys_from_laravel_doc_forum.txt, leaked_from_app_php.txt,
    snipe-it_default.txt)
